# Required
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL="https://your-deployment-here.convex.cloud" # The Convex deployment the shop reads its catalog and carts from. `bun run setup` at the repository root writes it to .env.local; Vercel builds set it themselves.

# VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL is provided by Vercel.

# Optional
SHOP_SECRET="" # A long random secret, the same as SHOP_SECRET on the Convex deployment: once both have it, Stripe's page opens only for the shop's server, and each visitor has a limit of their own. Set it here first, then on Convex.
SITE_PASSWORD="" # While Jolene isn't public, the password every page of the shop and the studio asks for first, the same on both Vercel projects (ADR 0022). Leave it empty for an open site.
